title: 'McIntosh, Kamei, Adams and Hassan (2014): components with low review coverage and participation had more defects after release, in Qt, VTK and ITK.'
pid: 796ffd91-ccd1-427e-9c83-7d3aaf5408a6
body: |2-
  https://rebels.cs.uwaterloo.ca/confpaper/2014/05/30/the-impact-of-code-review-coverage-and-code-review-participation-on-software-quality.html
  Summary, unchecked: up to two and five more defects per component. A
  replication at Sony Mobile (2016) found no such relation. Took
  little: weak support for reviewing every change; our own count is
  stronger.
